   "zh": "乔治，你期待幼儿园吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.161,
   "end": 40.36,
   "en": "Daddy, maybe George is too small to go to my Playgroup.",
   "i": 10,
   "zh": "爸爸，也许乔治太小了，不能去我的幼儿园。"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.881,
   "end": 42.8,
   "en": "He'll be fine, Peppa.",
   "i": 11,
   "zh": "他会没事的，佩奇。"
  },
  {
